  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National and provincial social protection frameworks strengthened, resulting in reduced inequities and expanded coverage to vulnerable groups and the informal sector through modernized and more effici</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected change is that Pakistan strengthens its capacity to extend inclusive and sustainable labour and social protection to workers at high risk of exclusion through coherent policies, stronger governance and digital innovation. Government institutions will expand coverage to vulnerable groups, improve financing and coordination, and link social protection with employment, skills and formalization strategies. By modernizing service delivery systems and reinforcing social dialogue, Pakistan will advance toward more universal, resilient and efficient protection systems that reduce vulnerability and promote decent work and social justice.</narrative>
  </description>
